+          <p class="eyebrow">Support</p>
+          <h1 id="page-title">Get help from our support team</h1>
+          <p>
+            Share your contact details and we will follow up with the right next
+            step for your account, billing, or product questions.
+          </p>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="support-card" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
+          <div class="support-layout">
+            <div class="support-summary">
+              <h2>What happens next</h2>
+              <p>
+                A support specialist reviews every request and replies with the
+                fastest path to resolution.
+              </p>
+              <ul class="support-points">
+                <li>
+                  <strong>Fast triage</strong>
+                  We route your request to the right team right away.
+                </li>
+                <li>
+                  <strong>Clear updates</strong>
+                  Expect a response using the email address you share below.
